{"id":"904b0609d7cbf868","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-connection.md","title":"Connection","display":"df-connection — Connection","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-connection","aliases":["58-df-connection","Connection"],"display":"df-connection — Connection","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-vector-bundle.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-covariant-derivative.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-connection"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-connection</span><span>Connection</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-connection — Connection"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bb62713ade4dcadf\" href=\"?note=bb62713ade4dcadf\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-vector-bundle.md\">../batch17/58-df-vector-bundle.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2ee05b1995ae05f1\" href=\"?note=2ee05b1995ae05f1\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-covariant-derivative.md\">../batch17/58-df-covariant-derivative.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f810bf542334e0d1\" href=\"?note=f810bf542334e0d1\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md\">../batch17/58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_\\nabla,\\nabla,\\pi,E,M,k,D\\in V\">\\(R_\\nabla,\\nabla,\\pi,E,M,k,D\\in V\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 的分量及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle\">\\(S=\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle\\)</span> 使用 <code>58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data</code> 的记录约定。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma(D)\">\\(\\Gamma(D)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak X(S)\">\\(\\mathfrak X(S)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[X,Y]\">\\([X,Y]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nabla_X^D s\">\\(\\nabla_X^D s\\)</span> 分别为内部定义的截面、向量场、Lie 括号和方向协变导数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Connection}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Connection}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CurvatureOfConnection}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CurvatureOfConnection}_S\\)</span> 保留五元、六元接口；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CurvatureData}_{58}(R_\\nabla,\\nabla,D)\">\\(\\mathrm{CurvatureData}_{58}(R_\\nabla,\\nabla,D)\\)</span> 显式固定共同结构。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CovDer}\">\\(\\mathrm{CovDer}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CovariantDerivativeData}\">\\(\\mathrm{CovariantDerivativeData}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2ee05b1995ae05f1\" href=\"?note=2ee05b1995ae05f1\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-covariant-derivative.md\">../batch17/58-df-covariant-derivative.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SectionCombination}\">\\(\\mathrm{SectionCombination}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f810bf542334e0d1\" href=\"?note=f810bf542334e0d1\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md\">../batch17/58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Connection}_S(\\nabla,\\pi,E,M,k)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CovDer}_S(\\nabla,\\pi,E,M,k).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Connection}_S(\\nabla,\\pi,E,M,k)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CovDer}_S(\\nabla,\\pi,E,M,k).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CurvatureData}_{58}(R_\\nabla,\\nabla,D)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CovariantDerivativeData}_{58}(\\nabla,D)\n\\land R_\\nabla\\in\\Gamma(D)^{\\mathfrak X(S)\\times\\mathfrak X(S)\\times\\Gamma(D)}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X,Y\\in\\mathfrak X(S)\\;\\forall s\\in\\Gamma(D)\\;\nR_\\nabla(X,Y,s)=\\mathrm{SectionCombination}_{58}\\bigl(D,1,\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\mathrm{SectionCombination}_{58}(D,1,\\nabla_X^D(\\nabla_Y^Ds),-1,\\nabla_Y^D(\\nabla_X^Ds)),-1,\\nabla_{[X,Y]}^Ds\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CurvatureData}_{58}(R_\\nabla,\\nabla,D)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CovariantDerivativeData}_{58}(\\nabla,D)\n\\land R_\\nabla\\in\\Gamma(D)^{\\mathfrak X(S)\\times\\mathfrak X(S)\\times\\Gamma(D)}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X,Y\\in\\mathfrak X(S)\\;\\forall s\\in\\Gamma(D)\\;\nR_\\nabla(X,Y,s)=\\mathrm{SectionCombination}_{58}\\bigl(D,1,\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\mathrm{SectionCombination}_{58}(D,1,\\nabla_X^D(\\nabla_Y^Ds),-1,\\nabla_Y^D(\\nabla_X^Ds)),-1,\\nabla_{[X,Y]}^Ds\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CurvatureOfConnection}_S(R_\\nabla,\\nabla,\\pi,E,M,k)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists D\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}_{58}(D,\\pi,E,M,k)\n\\land\\mathrm{CurvatureData}_{58}(R_\\nabla,\\nabla,D)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{CurvatureOfConnection}_S(R_\\nabla,\\nabla,\\pi,E,M,k)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists D\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}_{58}(D,\\pi,E,M,k)\n\\land\\mathrm{CurvatureData}_{58}(R_\\nabla,\\nabla,D)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>联络别名不变；曲率现通过同一丛结构上的方向协变导数、截面减法及已定义的 Lie 括号给出。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Kobayashi and Nomizu, Foundations of Differential Geometry</li>\n<li>do Carmo, Riemannian Geometry</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-vector-bundle.md","status":"resolved","id":"bb62713ade4dcadf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-vector-bundle.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-covariant-derivative.md","status":"resolved","id":"2ee05b1995ae05f1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-covariant-derivative.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"f810bf542334e0d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-covariant-derivative.md","status":"resolved","id":"2ee05b1995ae05f1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{CovDer}$、$\\mathrm{CovariantDerivativeData}$ 取 [[../batch17/58-df-covariant-derivative.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"f810bf542334e0d1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{SectionCombination}$、$\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}$ 取 [[../batch17/58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R_\\nabla,\\nabla,\\pi,E,M,k,D\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"S=\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma(D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak X(S)","display":false},{"tex":"[X,Y]","display":false},{"tex":"\\nabla_X^D s","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Connection}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CurvatureOfConnection}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CurvatureData}_{58}(R_\\nabla,\\nabla,D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CovDer}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CovariantDerivativeData}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SectionCombination}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Connection}_S(\\nabla,\\pi,E,M,k)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CovDer}_S(\\nabla,\\pi,E,M,k).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CurvatureData}_{58}(R_\\nabla,\\nabla,D)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{CovariantDerivativeData}_{58}(\\nabla,D)\n\\land R_\\nabla\\in\\Gamma(D)^{\\mathfrak X(S)\\times\\mathfrak X(S)\\times\\Gamma(D)}\\\\\n&\\land\\forall X,Y\\in\\mathfrak X(S)\\;\\forall s\\in\\Gamma(D)\\;\nR_\\nabla(X,Y,s)=\\mathrm{SectionCombination}_{58}\\bigl(D,1,\\\\\n&\\qquad\\mathrm{SectionCombination}_{58}(D,1,\\nabla_X^D(\\nabla_Y^Ds),-1,\\nabla_Y^D(\\nabla_X^Ds)),-1,\\nabla_{[X,Y]}^Ds\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CurvatureOfConnection}_S(R_\\nabla,\\nabla,\\pi,E,M,k)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists D\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}_{58}(D,\\pi,E,M,k)\n\\land\\mathrm{CurvatureData}_{58}(R_\\nabla,\\nabla,D)\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":2215,"backlinks":[{"id":"5cfc0a9f57224437","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"afa5f963c264afee","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0b88ba4114f012c8","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{CurvatureData}$ 取 [[../batch11/58-df-connection.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-351","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-connection.md|58-df-connection]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["bb62713ade4dcadf","2ee05b1995ae05f1","f810bf542334e0d1"]}